* ARRAY DEMO
* -----------
* Allocates a 50-element array, stores three names, and prints them.
*   ARRAY('1:50')   creates an array indexed 1..50
*   NAMES<i>        accesses element i (angle brackets, not parens)
*   OUTPUT = expr   prints expr as a line of output
       NAMES = ARRAY('1:50')
       NAMES<1> = 'Alice'
       NAMES<2> = 'Bob'
       NAMES<3> = 'Carol'
       OUTPUT = NAMES<1>
       OUTPUT = NAMES<2>
       OUTPUT = NAMES<3>
END
